        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kömwochï Tororöt Yoswö kïpar Kanan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kirapas Musa mötworinto ECHOTYON, kïlenchï ECHOTYON Yoswö wero Nun nyo kile kingörokintö Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kima mötworintenyan Musa, ngeta wïyö ye oghyenö lalwa Yordan, nyi nko pipö Israel atanga kor nyo otöninan chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okonokwa wölini löwïr katyakekwa kelyekwo lenyini kyoyomistan Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïngata surkwen nko Lepanon ntökwit lalwanay wow kïkuro Yuparet, koro pipö Ititi ntökwit nanampa Kwen, kïparta wölnö le ta, kïlïkwï korenkwa nyoni kïmïkul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.11.24+DEU.11.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Krt 11:24-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Möminye chi nyo weröy tawungu ato tesöpenyi, le ato kyomitan nko Musa, omitan nko nyi melö opïsteninyi anta apakadinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.31.6+DEU.31.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Krt 31:6-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.31.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichïchïm ainyakanitï, ompöwölo nyi nyo intöghoghchini pïchï kïmïl kor nyo kyawalwalan lö otöninan kukötïnekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo ichïchïm ainyakanitï tya, ateripö airïp kirurut löwïr cho kimwowunyi mötworintenyan Musa, mepeny ompö or anka tïkwïl löt, atökesoyönïn ompö wöloni iwestegho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mewutyeghö isomön kitapu Kirurut,* wölo inan pöghet nko nangat, aterïpa lasiny aigh le otini kikekir, atökesoyönïn ompö ighisyewutköku löwïr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inan lö ani, ECHOTYON Tororötïngu nyo kyomwowunyi lö, ichichïm ainyakanitï, mewöghisyö anta meghïn mu, ompöwölo omitan nko nyi ompö wop anka tïkwïl nyo iwesteghonyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ngal cho kömwochï Yoswö pich",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïmwochï Yoswö yetïntino pich lö, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aweratena keston alenchï pich, ‘Agha omisyö, ompöwölo kitomö kuwer osiswö sömökï opetekwa oghsot lalwa Yordan kïtomö kuwer osiswö sömökï, atachenga koronay konokwa ECHOTYON Tororötïngwo kïlïkwï nyinkwa.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.32.28+NUM.32.29+NUM.32.30+NUM.32.31+NUM.32.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kiy 32:28-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.3.18+DEU.3.19+DEU.3.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Krt 3:18-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.22.1+JOS.22.2+JOS.22.3+JOS.22.4+JOS.22.5+JOS.22.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 22:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Yoswö pipö ara Rupen nko ara Kad nko kareranpa ara Manase, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Anana ngölyontonay kimwowokwa Musa mötworinto ECHOTYON lö, ‘Konokwa ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa kor nyo omungokwa ompö kalya.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dongöy korukwa nko monekwa nko kyakikwa koronay kikonokwa Musa ompö Yordan okumpö kongasis. Wölo nyoghöy kwoghsot pich cho le nyökon cho kinap kegh ompö poryot atökungarak werkökwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ntökïtenö kutö ECHOTYON chane kalya le akwa akïcheng chane tïkwïl kor nyo töni Tororöt. Atolapay omïlisyekwa nyu amang korengwo, nyay kikonokwa Musa mötworinto ECHOTYON, ompö Yordan okumpö kongasis.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï chane Yoswö lö, “Kighecha choni löwïr kemwoghwechanyi akepetecha wop anka tïkwïl wölo kemwoghwechanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Le otini kikïkonyïtöcha Musa ompö tïkwïn löwïr, kekonyïtecha nyi, nya kïtöpö ECHOTYON Tororötïngu nko nyi le ato kimi nko Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chi anka tïkwïl nyo penyöy ngaleku akïtagh kïterunyi, kepöröy, wölo ichichïm ainyakanitï.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kayonta Yoswö ghotï kïpa Yeriko",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
